zuhttp is licensed under the MIT license (see LICENSE).

It compiles in three vendored libraries, both under permissive licenses whose
full texts are installed with the package, in licenses/:

  picohttpparser   MIT (upstream is MIT or Perl; used here under MIT)
                   licenses/picohttpparser-LICENSE
  uriparser        BSD-3-Clause (a subset: parse, resolve, recompose)
                   licenses/uriparser-LICENSE
  nghttp2          MIT (lib/ only: HTTP/2 framing, HPACK, flow control)
                   licenses/nghttp2-LICENSE

Copyright holders, upstream versions and the exact files included are listed
in COPYRIGHTS. zlib and the platform TLS stack (OpenSSL, Schannel, or
Security.framework) are linked from the system and not distributed here.
